Route data in this directory is derived from OpenStreetMap.

© OpenStreetMap contributors. Available under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Routes were computed with OSRM (https://project-osrm.org) using the public demo
server, once, by scripts/precompute-routes.ts. The source code of this project is
MIT-licensed; this data is not — it remains under the ODbL.
